        <span class="tag">Metals</span>
        <h3>Metals Warehousing &amp; FTZ-Eligible Storage</h3>
        <p>Inbound and outbound handling for copper, aluminum, steel, and other metals, with inventory control and documentation built for exchange-grade material. This site sits inside the Georgia FTZ service area — ask about duty-deferral options for your product.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Rail</span>
        <h3>Railcar Storage</h3>
        <p>~60 spots for private and leased railcars — short-term surge capacity or a standing arrangement, sized to your fleet, so cars aren't racking up per-diem in a congested origin yard.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Bulk</span>
        <h3>Bulk Material Storage &amp; Transloading</h3>
        <p>Outdoor and covered storage for resin, chemicals, aggregates, and other bulk commodities. Rail-to-truck transload and container stuffing for export-bound material, including supersack packing for PVC and other resins.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Processing</span>
        <h3>Toll Processing &amp; Contract Packaging</h3>
        <p>Cutting, blending, bagging, and repackaging for customers who need value added before material moves again. Overflow yard space for local fabricators running tight on their own footprint.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Project Cargo</span>
        <h3>Project &amp; Breakbulk Cargo</h3>
        <p>Storage and staging for oversized, heavy-lift, and breakbulk shipments that don't fit a standard dock.</p>
